5. SATURDAY–FRIDAY WEEK MANAGEMENT

The official reporting week is Saturday through Friday.

For every date, calculate the corresponding week using:

- Start date: Saturday.
- End date: the following Friday.
- Time zone: Asia/Kolkata.

Examples:

- 26/09/2026–02/10/2026.
- 17/10/2026–23/10/2026.
- 24/10/2026–30/10/2026.

Generate the active week automatically using the current date. Users must also be able to navigate to previous and future weeks.

Do not use Monday–Sunday weeks.

Every weekly dashboard must show seven date slots. A date with no entries must not automatically create payable labour or be interpreted as paid attendance.

Support multiple attendance entries for the same team on the same date. Different shifts, different batches, or separate entries with different working times must be permitted.

Prevent duplicate submissions caused by repeated taps or network retries, but never prohibit legitimate multiple entries on one date.

